{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Regulate ride-hailing fares for drivers and riders",
        "additional_details": "This petition calls on Government to create clear, fair rules for ride-hailing prices. It asks for a regulated base fare, transparent rates per mile or kilometre, and reasonable limits on surge pricing. These measures would protect passengers from unexpected costs, help drivers receive more predictable and sustainable earnings, promote fair competition between platforms, and ensure that ride-hailing prices are transparent, understandable, and reasonable for everyone.",
        "background": "We petition Government to regulate ride-hailing fares. Set a fair base fare, transparent per-mile or per-kilometre rates, and clear surge-pricing limits to protect passengers and drivers, promote fair competition, ensure predictable earnings, and provide reasonable, transparent prices.",
